                    </label>
                    <div class="input-group input-group-lg">
                        <input type="number" class="form-control font-weight-bold text-primary" id="inputEndKm" 
                               value="@(Model.StartKm ?? Model.CurrentVehicleKm)" 
                               min="@(Model.StartKm ?? Model.CurrentVehicleKm)" 
                               placeholder="Örn: @(Model.StartKm ?? Model.CurrentVehicleKm)">
                        <div class="input-group-append">
                            <span class="input-group-text font-weight-bold">KM</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <small class="form-text text-muted">
                        Başlangıç KM: <strong>@((Model.StartKm ?? Model.CurrentVehicleKm).ToString("N0")) KM</strong>
                    </small>
                    <div id="tripDistanceExceededAlert" class="alert alert-danger py-2 px-3 mt-2 d-none" style="border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; border-left: 4px solid #dc3545;">
                        <i class="fa fa-exclamation-circle text-danger mr-1 font-16"></i>
                        <strong>Mesafe Uyarısı:</strong> Yapılan mesafe (<span id="tripDistanceValue" class="font-weight-bold">0</span> KM) 200 KM eşiğini aşmaktadır! Lütfen girdiğiniz bitiş kilometresini kontrol ediniz.
